{
  "thought": "The supplied description suggests deteriorating revenue quality and weakening customer demand, while unusually high R&D spending raises profitability and funding risks. Partnership and AI headlines do not establish commercial success without verified revenue, margin, and cash-flow contributions. No financial statements, valuation data, or independently verified news are provided, limiting confidence in the downside assessment.",
  "verdict": "Sell",
  "message": "I agree with Agents D6, D1, and D5 that peer consensus is not independent evidence. Maintain Sell, conditional on the supplied business description; Strong Sell is not justified without valuation and liquidity data. Verify customer retention, organic growth, R&D-to-revenue trends, operating cash flow, and funding runway. Reassess if core demand stabilizes and AI initiatives generate profitable growth without weakening cash generation, while checking whether the current valuation already reflects these risks."
